    "raw_output": "```javascript\nexports.ringBufferTrace = function(capacity, values) {\n  if (typeof capacity !== 'number' || capacity <= 0) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  if (typeof values !== 'number' || values === -1) {\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  const result = new Array(capacity);\n  let head = 0;\n  let tail = 0;\n  let count = 0;\n\n  for (const value of values) {\n    if (count >= capacity) {\n      result[tail] = -1;\n      tail = (tail + 1) % capacity;\n      count = 0;\n    }\n\n    if (value === -1) {\n      result[tail] = -1;\n      tail = (tail + 1) % capacity;\n      count = 0;\n    } else {\n      result[tail] = value;\n      tail = (tail + 1) % capacity;\n      count++;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return result;\n};\n```<|im_end|>",
